{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f0a1b2c3-d4e5-6789-0abc-def123456789",
    "name": "Axis Assistant API",
    "description": "Full API collection for the Axis Assistant platform.\n\n**Auth:** All endpoints (except /health) require the `X-API-Key` header.\n\n**Response envelope:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": { ... },\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": { \"request_id\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\" }\n}\n```\n\n**Error codes follow the grammar:** `<service>.<category>`\n- `backend.*` — Go backend errors\n- `agent.*` — Python agent errors\n- `external.*` — third-party errors\n\n**New in v2:** Voice transcription (Whisper), AI model selection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "X-API-Key", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{api_key}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "No auth required. Returns `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` if the backend is running."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Agent Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agent_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{agent_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "No auth required. Returns `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` from the Python agent."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Health check endpoints for both services."
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send Message",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Ensure session_id is set",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('session_id')) {",
                  "    console.warn('⚠️ session_id is empty. Create a session first.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"session_id\": \"{{session_id}}\",\n  \"message\": \"What's on my calendar today?\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Send a message to the AI agent.\n\n**Requires** an active `session_id` — create one via Sessions > Create Session first.\n\nThe Go backend proxies this to the Python agent's `/orchestrate` endpoint. The response includes the AI reply, detected intent, tools used, and latency."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Chat endpoints — the main conversational interface."
    },
    {
      "name": "Voice (Whisper)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Transcribe Audio",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "",
                  "description": "Audio file (wav, mp3, m4a, flac, ogg, webm, mp4, mpeg, mpga, oga)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/voice",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "voice"]
            },
            "description": "Upload an audio file for speech-to-text transcription using OpenAI Whisper.\n\n**Supported formats:** flac, m4a, mp3, mp4, mpeg, mpga, oga, ogg, wav, webm\n\n**Max file size:** 25 MB\n\n**Requires:** `OPENAI_API_KEY` to be configured (Whisper always uses OpenAI, regardless of the chat provider).\n\nThe response contains the transcribed text. You can then send the transcription as a chat message via `POST /api/v1/chat`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Transcribe Audio (Agent Direct)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{api_key}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "",
                  "description": "Audio file"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{agent_url}}/voice",
              "host": ["{{agent_url}}"],
              "path": ["voice"]
            },
            "description": "Call the agent's Whisper endpoint directly (bypassing Go backend).\n\nUseful for debugging."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Voice-to-text transcription using OpenAI Whisper API.\n\nUpload audio → get transcribed text → send to chat."
    },
    {
      "name": "AI Models",
